"}},{"id":"WP1028205","name":{"zh":"珠玉翘楚小冠","en":"Jeweled Paragon Crown"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"经过华丽处理的贤士冠，多为朝中身居要职之人佩戴。","en":"An ornately finished scholar's crown, worn by those holding high court positions."},"mp":"1500","evade":"8","price":"9500","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"children":{"label":{"zh":"子女","en":"Children"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10095","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI107215","name":{"zh":"丹阳朱氏","en":"The Zhu Clan of Danyang"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自曹姓，邾子之后，去邑为朱氏，丹阳郡名门。朱治、朱然为东吴名将，朱治佐孙氏三世，朱然守江陵拒魏，父子皆显。","en":"Originating from the Cao surname as descendants of the Viscounts of Zhu, they dropped the city radical to take Zhu as their surname, becoming an illustrious clan of Danyang Commandery. Zhu Zhi and Zhu Ran were famed generals of Eastern Wu, Zhu Zhi assisted three generations of the Sun family, while Zhu Ran held Jiangling against Wei, winning great renown for both father and son."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"1","politics":"4"}}],"friendGroups":[{"story":"S10202","members":["WJ10040","WJ10363","WJ10021","WJ10027","WJ10041"]},{"story":"S10702","members":["WJ10020","WJ10021","WJ10027","WJ10041","WJ10078","WJ10079","WJ10080","WJ10095","WJ10175","WJ10190","WJ10022","WJ10590","WJ10140","WJ10090","WJ10091","WJ10038","WJ10143","WJ10258","WJ10499","WJ10363","WJ10028","WJ10093","WJ10107","WJ10026","WJ10113","WJ10097","WJ10023","WJ10096","WJ10098","WJ10211"]},{"story":"S10115","members":["WJ10020","WJ10027","WJ10080","WJ10095","WJ10091","WJ10363","WJ10093","WJ10107","WJ10026","WJ10113","WJ10097","WJ10096","WJ10098","WJ10211"]},{"story":"S10915","members":["WJ10020","WJ10027","WJ10080","WJ10095","WJ10091","WJ10363","WJ10093","WJ10107","WJ10026","WJ10113","WJ10097","WJ10096","WJ10098","WJ10211"]},{"story":"S11015","members":["WJ10020","WJ10027","WJ10080","WJ10095","WJ10091","WJ10363","WJ10093","WJ10107","WJ10026","WJ10113","WJ10097","WJ10096","WJ10098","WJ10211"]},{"story":"S11115","members":["WJ10020","WJ100