S1071","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[71,56,72,73,75,65],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"120","reputation":"24800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1006905","helmet":"WP1028205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[71,56,72,73,75,65],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1006905","helmet":"WP1028205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10038","city":"CS1071","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,56,72,73,75,65],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1006905","helmet":"WP1028205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"早年历经县吏，通过察举后为孝廉，故被任为州内从事，开始跟随孙坚，随其讨伐长沙等地过程中屡立战功。孙坚战死后便辅佐孙策依靠袁术，后同其他将士共劝孙策返回江东自立，助其平定江东。孙策遇害后，与张昭、张纮、周瑜等人一同辅佐年少的孙权，赤壁之战时领周瑜之命与吕范共任四方巡警使，以督军队。","tc":"早年歷經縣吏，通過察舉后為孝廉，故被任為州內從事，開始跟隨孫堅，隨其討伐長沙等地過程中屢立戰功。孫堅戰死后便輔佐孫策依靠袁術，后同其他將士共勸孫策返回江東自立，助其平定江東。孫策遇害后，與張昭、張纮、周瑜等人一同輔佐年少的孫權，赤壁之戰時領周瑜之命與呂范共任四方巡警使，以督軍隊。","en":"He began his career as a county clerk, was nominated as Filial and Incorrupt, and appointed as a provincial attendant, beginning his service under Sun Jian. He followed Sun Jian through the campaign to suppress Changsha and other regions, earning repeated merit. After Sun Jian's death, he aided Sun Ce in relying on Yuan Shu, then joined other officers in urging Sun Ce to return to Jiangdong and forge his own path, helping him pacify the region. After Sun Ce's assassination, he assisted Zhang Zhao, Zhang Hong, Zhou Yu, and others in guiding the young Sun Quan. During the Battle of Red Cliffs, under Zhou Yu's orders, he and Lu Fan served as roving inspectors of the four directions to oversee the troops.","jp":"若くして県吏を務め、察挙により孝廉に推挙されて州従事に任じられた。孫堅に従うようになってからは、長沙などの討伐に従軍して度々軍功を挙げた。孫堅が戦死した後は孫策を補佐して袁術を頼り、後に他の将兵らとともに孫策へ江東に戻って自立するよう勧め、江東平定に尽力した。孫策が命を落とした後は、張昭、張紘、周瑜らとともに年少の孫権を補佐した。赤壁の戦いでは周瑜の命を受け、呂範とともに四方巡警使を務めて軍を監督した。","kr":"초년에 현리를 지내고 효렴으로 천거되어 주 종사에 임명되었으며, 손견을 섬기기 시작한 뒤 그를 따라 장사 등지를 토벌하며 여러 차례 전공을 세웠다. 손견이 전사하자 손책을 보좌하여 원술에게 의탁했고, 이후 다른 장수들과 함께 손책에게 강동으로 돌아가 자립할 것을 권하여 강동 평정을 도왔다. 손책이 변을 당한 후에는 장소, 장굉, 주유 등과 함께 어린 손권을 보좌했으며, 적벽대전 당시 주유의 명을 받아 여범과 함께 사방순경사를 맡아 군대를 감찰했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10139","remark":"","surname":"朱","surnameTc":"朱","surnameEn":"Zhu","surnameJp":"朱","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"治","nameTc":"治","nameEn":"Zhi","nameJp":"治","nameKr":"치","nameOther":"","word":"君理","wordTc":"君理","wordEn":"Junli","wordJp":"君理","wordKr":"군리","wordOther":"","icon":"朱治","power":"WJ10038","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1047","gender":"0","rule":"71","force":"56","wise":"72","politics":"73","charm":"75","will":"65","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"19/19/19/56/19/51/50/19","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000805","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"3100","debateSoulPoint":"5100","strategy":"","strategy2":"1008401","professions":"2/2/2/3/0/0/2/3/1/3/0/0/0/2/0/3/0/1/0/1/0/2/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"84","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9500","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"5","birth":"156","show":"184","death":"224","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP100690